{"ref":"BDB, אַתֶּם","hw":"אַתֶּם","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַתֶּם</span></big>  <strong>pron. 2 m.pl. you</strong> (masc.) <strong>(</strong>for <em>antem</em>, v. supr.<strong>)</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:7\" href=\"/Genesis.9.7\">Gn 9:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:27\" href=\"/Genesis.26.27\">26:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:4\" href=\"/Genesis.29.4\">29:4</a> + often. With <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאַתֶּם</span> †<a data-ref=\"Judges 6:31\" href=\"/Judges.6.31\">Ju 6:31</a>; following the vb. for emph. <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:12\" href=\"/Judges.15.12\">Ju 15:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 34:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.34.15\">Je 34:15</a>; construed inaccurately with a fem. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.20\">Ez 13:20</a>.","next":"BDB, אַתֵּן","prev":"BDB, אַתְּ"}